{"id": "119913", "name": "אינטגרל לא מסוים של √(1−x²) – הצבה x=sin(u)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>תוך שימוש בהצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}={{CT:1}}\\)</span> חשבו</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:2}}\\,d{{CT:0}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> ההצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=\\sin u\\)</span> הופכת את השורש ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos u\\)</span>. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos^2 u\\)</span> מורידים בזהות של הזווית הכפולה, ובסוף חוזרים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההצבה</b><br><p>נציב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=\\sin u\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\le u\\le \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=\\arcsin x\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dx=\\cos u\\,du\\)</span>, ובתחום הזה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos u\\ge 0\\)</span>, ולכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{1-x^2}=\\sqrt{1-\\sin^2 u}=\\sqrt{\\cos^2 u}=\\cos u \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:2}}\\,d{{CT:0}}=\\int \\cos u\\cdot\\cos u\\,du=\\int \\cos^2 u\\,du \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הורדת החזקה</b><br><p>לפי הזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos^2 u=\\frac{1+\\cos 2u}{2}\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int \\cos^2 u\\,du=\\int \\frac{1+\\cos 2u}{2}\\,du=\\frac{u}{2}+\\frac{\\sin 2u}{4}+C \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — חזרה למשתנה x</b><br><p>לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin 2u=2\\sin u\\cos u=2x\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=\\arcsin x\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:2}}\\,d{{CT:0}}=\\frac{\\arcsin x}{2}+\\frac{x\\sqrt{1-x^2}}{2}+C={{CT:3}}+C \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nvarss:delete(C,delete(c,varss));\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nstu:ev(diff(an1,v));\nc1:ev(diff(an1,c));\nc2:ev(diff(an1,C));\nd:c1^2+c2^2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "p", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp", "q", "v"], "nvariants": 1}